# The SDK cache is TRACKED and COMPLETE. Owner decision: sold apps must be
# self-contained, and the composer's version/hash reconciliation treats the
# committed cache as the source of truth - a cache missing files reads as
# "LOCAL MODIFICATIONS" and is pinned forever, never refetched.
#
# Unanchored rules in ancestor .gitignore files (the root's lib/ and *.g.dart
# family, .rokct/'s skills/ and tmp/) used to match inside the cache too, so
# CI commit-backs silently stripped code out of every vendored SDK. This file
# is deeper than all of those, so its patterns win for everything under
# .rokct/cache/: re-include everything, then re-ignore only toolchain noise
# (mirroring the composer's HASH_EXCLUDED_DIRS).
!**

.dart_tool/
build/
__pycache__/
node_modules/
*.pyc
